能力，善于在复杂的业务流和数据流中梳理逻辑关系，独立分析和建立分析逻辑，识别并发现问题。\n5.善于沟通和协调且有责任心，独立积极的密切跟踪部门内部的各项事宜，直至问题被有效解决和关闭。\n6.英文听说读写的能力。\n7.熟练使用SAP系统，有SAP系统和供应链相关的定制化系统二开经验优先。\n8.熟练使用Office软件，有其是Excel大数据处理分析能力。\n9.有使用SRM系统的经验优先。","ClassificationOne":"社会招聘","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-14T11:22:57","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"02fe6d07-d0ed-4cbe-99b1-ea5c96db9667","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190858037,"PostDateInt":1788434293000,"PostDate":"2026-09-03T19:18:13","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"质量工程师（SQE）","OrgId":3207301,"Org":"SQE","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市·浦东新区"],"Salary":"10K-15K 元/月","Duty":"1. 负责供应商质量管理工作；\n2. 负责供应商的准入审核、合格供应商的年度审核、绩效评价；\n3. 负责对供应商质量进行管控，数据统计以达到标准的要求；\n4. 负责供应商新品试制过程跟踪、样件验